{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":71684705,"ns":0,"title":"Big Stan (drill rig)","extract":"Big Stan is a vehicle-mounted drill rig built in 1986 by Anderson Drilling. The rig has been used on a number of construction projects in which conventional, smaller drilling rigs were unable to be used, particularly when projects call for drilling into hard soil.","description":"Large vehicle mounted drill rig","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}